<title>USA: U.S. stocks open lower.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks open lower.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened  opened lower on Tuesday, extending the previous day's losses with segments of the technology sector coming under pressure.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were off 16.31 at 7273.09 and the Nasdaq Composite was down 8.14 at 1396.65.</p>
